WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,010
Yong'er

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,540
Dad doesn't object to you making friends

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,100
As for the craftsmen

4
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:07,140
Brother Fang Yang may need you more than we do, so don’t ask for it.

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,620
Don’t worry about getting along with your brother Fang Yang from now on

6
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,810
Where do you put your share paperwork?

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:13,970
Why aren't you here?

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,980
in my arms

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,120
This agreement documents dividends

10
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,720
Just ask your mother to keep it for you

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,120
You are too young to grasp it

12
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,040
No, dad, this money

13
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,400
I was robbed by my parents

14
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,960
Brother Fang Yang was wrong after all.

15
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:31,960
Wrong money

16
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,000
It's better to grab it quickly

17
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,460
Wang Bao, are you talking about the little eunuch who buys wine?

18
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,420
I saw the prince entering into the sin of immortals

19
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,500
Yes, when the little eunuch comes back

20
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,460
His Royal Highness the Crown Prince has not come out of the restaurant yet.

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,840
Ask someone to seal the wine and seal it. Come to the East Palace.

22
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,500
Have money

23
00:00:54,700 --> 00:01:00,610
Finally, we no longer have to wait for the palace to send money, right? Feng Huang
